# Google Maps Platform API Key for browser SDK (@vis.gl/react-google-maps, Places API New)
# Also used as a fallback by the Next.js /api/* Route Handlers when GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY is unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional dedicated server-side key (recommended in production for IP-restricted REST calls:
# Address Validation API, Routes API, Maps Static API).
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_google_maps_api_key_here

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quickstart: Get a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key.
# 5. Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace `your_google_maps_api_key_here`.
#
# Note: For production (or APIs outside the Demo Key scope such as Address
# Validation / Maps Static API), create and restrict your own Google Cloud
# API key at:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Address Validation API,
#         Routes API, and Maps Static API.
